  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the UN Coherence in Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In July 2010, the Afghan President requested the UN to adopt a &#xbf;One UN&#xbf; approach and the UNSG accepted the president&#xbf;s request. This challenge prompted the UN to rethink its approach to strategic framework, where it can work better more coherently in support Afghans and the Government&#xbf;s evolving development Strategies. The UN Resident Coordinator Office was tasked to develop a 3 year plan for the implementation of &#xbf;Delivery as One&#xbf; initiative. This initiation plan aimed at developing the implementation plan of the &#xbf;Delivery as One&#xbf; in Afghanistan.</narrative>
  </description>
